{"bltd8650d46ab15e929":{"title":"Contentstack Kickstart","url":"/","description":"This is an entry for a Contentstack Kickstart","image":{"uid":"blt4c54859cb93d4007","created_at":"2025-09-17T08:21:47.690Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T08:21:47.690Z","created_by":"blt8fa8498bc954be3e","updated_by":"blt8fa8498bc954be3e","content_type":"image/jpeg","file_size":"390579","tags":[],"filename":"contentstack-kickstarts.jpg","url":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/bltde744774bbf13be8/blt4c54859cb93d4007/68ca6f9b98d03f0c5254e1f3/contentstack-kickstarts.jpg","ACL":[],"is_dir":false,"parent_uid":null,"_version":1,"title":"contentstack-kickstarts.jpg","publish_details":[{"environment":"bltf3661bcc457d9e61","locale":"en-us","time":"2025-09-17T08:21:50.803Z","user":"blt8fa8498bc954be3e","version":1}]},"rich_text":"<p>Contentstack Kickstarts are the <strong>minimum</strong> amount of code needed to connect to contentstack using the <a href=\"https://www.contentstack.com/docs/developers/sdks/content-delivery-sdk/typescript\" target=\"_blank\">SDK</a>, and with <a href=\"https://www.contentstack.com/docs/content-managers/visual-builder\" target=\"_blank\">visual building</a> enabled.</p>","tags":[],"locale":"en-us","ACL":{},"blocks":[{"block":{"title":"This is a modular block","_metadata":{"uid":"cs0b5b088edb5b35db"},"copy":"<p>Contentstack <a href=\"https://www.contentstack.com/docs/developers/create-content-types/modular-blocks\" target=\"_blank\">Modular Blocks</a> allow you to dynamically create, arrange, and reuse content components within a single field, offering flexibility for building complex page layouts without changes to the content type structure.</p>","image":{"uid":"bltcdd1bfdfada48b8f","created_at":"2025-09-17T08:21:46.770Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T08:21:46.770Z","created_by":"blt8fa8498bc954be3e","updated_by":"blt8fa8498bc954be3e","content_type":"image/jpeg","file_size":"23969","tags":[],"filename":"csLogo_640x360.jpg","url":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/bltde744774bbf13be8/bltcdd1bfdfada48b8f/68ca6f9a97102da4f167f92d/csLogo_640x360.jpg","ACL":[],"is_dir":false,"parent_uid":null,"_version":1,"title":"csLogo_640x360.jpg","publish_details":[{"environment":"bltf3661bcc457d9e61","locale":"en-us","time":"2025-09-17T08:21:50.850Z","user":"blt8fa8498bc954be3e","version":1}]},"layout":"image_left"}},{"block":{"title":"Check out the Academy","_metadata":{"uid":"cs523d3c933232d1dc"},"copy":"<p>Contentstack offers courses and explainers on how to use the platform. Check out the course on <a href=\"https://www.contentstack.com/academy/courses/content-modeling\" target=\"_blank\">content modeling</a> and the more <a href=\"https://www.contentstack.com/academy/explore?filter=%5B%7B%22uid%22%3A%22coding%22%2C%22parentUid%22%3A%22content_type%22%7D%5D&page=1\" target=\"_blank\">development specific videos</a>.</p>","image":{"uid":"blt2e4f52b8cfcc4a6d","created_at":"2025-09-17T08:21:49.839Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T08:21:49.839Z","created_by":"blt8fa8498bc954be3e","updated_by":"blt8fa8498bc954be3e","content_type":"image/png","file_size":"663640","tags":[],"filename":"Opengraph_B.png","url":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/bltde744774bbf13be8/blt2e4f52b8cfcc4a6d/68ca6f9d429a94d4bca7612e/Opengraph_B.png","ACL":[],"is_dir":false,"parent_uid":null,"_version":1,"title":"Opengraph_B.png","publish_details":[{"environment":"bltf3661bcc457d9e61","locale":"en-us","time":"2025-09-17T08:21:52.059Z","user":"blt8fa8498bc954be3e","version":1}]},"layout":"image_right"}},{"block":{"title":"Join the community","_metadata":{"uid":"cs09fc98d8f7634344"},"copy":"<p>The <a href=\"https://community.contentstack.com\" target=\"_blank\">community</a> connects you with a vibrant network of like-minded developers to show off your work or to ask any quections.</p>","image":{"uid":"bltf0e1210dcd339357","created_at":"2025-09-17T08:21:48.797Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T08:21:48.797Z","created_by":"blt8fa8498bc954be3e","updated_by":"blt8fa8498bc954be3